{"4194160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Droid Kontrolle", "steam_appid": 4194160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colony ship <strong>New Earth</strong> no longer sends a signal. A corrupted AI calling itself <strong>ICPU</strong> has taken over the entire system and turned the crew droids into deadly machines. You are a forgotten prototype, the only one still able to act freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned ship in a top-down view, from the dark maintenance decks to the central servers. Every room holds danger, every enemy is a possible resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong><br>Hack, take over, control. Turn hostile droids into allies and use their weapons and abilities.<br>Build your prototype. Collect data fragments, install modules, and evolve into an unstoppable machine.<br>Explore a hostile ship. Uncover deck by deck, gather intelligence, and confront the AI <strong>ICPU</strong> that wants to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple. Find the central intelligence <strong>ICPU</strong> and destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival depends on logic, precision, and courage. The <strong>New Earth</strong> will give you nothing. Free the ship, find the source of the infection, and end the machine uprising.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colony ship <strong>New Earth</strong> no longer sends a signal. A corrupted AI calling itself <strong>ICPU</strong> has taken over the entire system and turned the crew droids into deadly machines. You are a forgotten prototype, the only one still able to act freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned ship in a top-down view, from the dark maintenance decks to the central servers. Every room holds danger, every enemy is a possible resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong><br>